;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
; File: system/plcmacro4.mac
; Desc: ATC Reset -- wireless MPG macro button 4
;
; The PLC maps MpgMacro4_M -> SV_SYS_MACRO = 4, which makes CNC12 load and run
; this file from \cncm\system\ while it is at the main menu.
;
; The reset action itself lives in mfunc20.mac (M20), shared with the VCP
; ATC RESET button, so there is one source of truth. See that file for why a
; dummy tool is needed and why there are two of them.
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;

;Skip if graphing or searching
IF #4201 || #4202 THEN GOTO 1000

M20             ; ATC Reset

N1000           ; end of program
